  <scopecontent id="302f68cb3f805fab517c5b265e98729c">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>David Lelewar's files pertain specifically to the Commission on Population Growth and the American Future and consist of transcripts of Commission hearings, copies of contract research, and correspondence concerning the organization of the Commission and the publication of its final report.</p><p>Joan Dunlop's files document the gradual broadening of John D. Rockefeller 3rd's activities in the 1970s as he moved away from strictly demographic and contraceptive research into the areas of abortion and human sexuality.</p>  </scopecontent>
